# 📘 Android Rulebook for Cursor App (Final with Designer XML Integration)

This rulebook defines both **Directory Rules** (project structure) and **Code Generation Rules** (implementation standards). Together, they ensure a clean, scalable, and maintainable Android codebase that adheres to **Clean Architecture**, **MVI**, and company-specific standards.

---

## 🗂 Directory Rules (Project Structure)

### General Project Structure
- The project must be modular.  
- The `app` module contains all application content, layered by function.  
- **MainActivity.kt** must reside in `com.example.drivehub_android/user_interface`.  

### Directory Layout
```
app/
├── src
    ├── main
        ├── java/com/example/drivehub_android/
            ├── data/
                ├── dto/request
                ├── dto/response
                ├── fixed
                ├── model
                ├── remote
            ├── dependency_injection/
            ├── domain/
                ├── Registration/
                    ├── RegistrationModel.kt
                    ├── RegistrationUseCase.kt
                ├── Login/
                    ├── LoginModel.kt
                    ├── LoginUseCase.kt
                ├── Dashboard/
                    ├── DashboardModel.kt
                    ├── DashboardUseCase.kt
            ├── navigation/
                ├── NavGraph.kt
                ├── NavigationProvider.kt
                ├── Screen.kt   ← moved outside, no `screen/` folder
            ├── repository/
            ├── theme/
                ├── Color.kt
                ├── Typography.kt
                ├── Shape.kt
            ├── user_interface/
                ├── Registration/
                    ├── RegistrationScreen.kt
                    ├── RegistrationViewModel.kt
                ├── Login/
                    ├── LoginScreen.kt
                    ├── LoginViewModel.kt
                ├── Dashboard/
                    ├── DashboardScreen.kt
                    ├── DashboardViewModel.kt
                ├── common/
            ├── utility/
                ├── extension/
                ├── function/
                ├── network/
                ├── storage/
        ├── res/
            ├── drawable/
            ├── drawable-hdpi/
            ├── drawable-mdpi/
            ├── drawable-xhdpi/
            ├── drawable-xxhdpi/
            ├── drawable-xxxhdpi/
            ├── font/
            ├── raw/
            ├── values/
                ├── colors.xml   ← designer-provided XML file (source of truth)
            ├── xml/
        ├── AndroidManifest.xml
```

### Resource Rules
- **Images**:  
  - >201 KB → `.svg` in `drawable/`.  
  - <200 KB → `.png` in density-specific folders (`drawable-mdpi`, `drawable-hdpi`, etc.).  
- **Fonts** → `res/font/`.  
- **Raw files** → `res/raw/` (e.g., Lottie animations).  
- **Values** → `res/values/` (colors, strings, dimensions).  
  - **Colors must be defined in `colors.xml` (designer handoff).**  
- **XML** → `res/xml/` (network configs, extraction rules).  

